{"articleNo":"240758","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=240758&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] [근로]2020-2학기 학기 중 대학근로장학생 모집 안내( 발열점검소 운영 보조)-기간연장-","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.08.18","hit":"9050","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><font size=\"5\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">- 2020-2학기 학기 중&nbsp;대학근로장학생 모집 안내 -</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><strong><u>발열점검소 운영보조 신청 안내 입니다.</u></strong></strong></span><br></p><div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br></p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>1.&nbsp;자격요건</strong></span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;2020-2학기&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;중&nbsp;직전학기&nbsp;성적&nbsp;70점/100점&nbsp;만점(평점&nbsp;1.6)&nbsp;이상</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;정규학기&nbsp;내&nbsp;재학생&nbsp;(휴학생,&nbsp;초과학기자&nbsp;제외)</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2.&nbsp;신청기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2020.</span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">8.13.(목)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~8.23.(일)&nbsp;18:00&nbsp;까지(기간 연장)</span></span></span></font></strong></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">3.&nbsp;근로기간</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.9.1.(화)~2020.12.20.(일)&nbsp;[학기&nbsp;중]</span><strong><strong></strong></strong></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><font size=\"3\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">4. 근로지 내역 : 학생처 학생지원팀</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></strong></strong></font></p></span><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">근로 업무 :&nbsp;테크노관, 글로벌관, 디지털관, 도서관&nbsp;발열점검소 운영 보조(출입구 안내)</span></span></span></strong></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">​&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 근로 시간 : 8~16시</span></strong></strong></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">5.&nbsp;부서&nbsp;신청방법</span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;희망부서&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;신청&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;→&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;선발&nbsp;확정&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;신청방법:&nbsp;원스톱서비스&nbsp;로그인&nbsp;-&nbsp;학생지원&nbsp;-&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;신청서&nbsp;제출</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청&nbsp;상세내역작성(계좌등록,&nbsp;근무부서,&nbsp;희망&nbsp;부서&nbsp;및&nbsp;희망근무시간&nbsp;입력)&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;신청버튼&nbsp;클릭&nbsp;-&nbsp;완료</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">※ 희망부서는 학생처 학생지원팀입니다.</span></strong></span></span></span></p></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong>6.&nbsp;선발일정</strong></span><br></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;학생:&nbsp;희망근무부서&nbsp;신청</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">[</span><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">2020.</span><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">8.13.(목)&nbsp;10:00&nbsp;~8.23.(일)&nbsp;18:00&nbsp;까지</span></strong></span></span></font><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">]</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나.&nbsp;각&nbsp;해당부서:&nbsp;각&nbsp;부서에서&nbsp;희망근무부서&nbsp;신청자&nbsp;명단&nbsp;확인하여&nbsp;해당&nbsp;학생에게&nbsp;연락&nbsp;확인&nbsp;후&nbsp;추천</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;다.&nbsp;학생처:&nbsp;근로장학생&nbsp;선발확정(예정)&nbsp;[2020.8.27.(목)]</span><br><strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">7.&nbsp;근로장학금액</span></strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;:&nbsp;근로&nbsp;다음달&nbsp;10일&nbsp;지급(10일이&nbsp;주말일&nbsp;경우&nbsp;금요일에&nbsp;지급)</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 시간당&nbsp;급여&nbsp;8,590원</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
